  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Over, under, next door",
   "texto": [
    "These expressions carry **de**, which is merged with the article: from + or = **do**, from + to = **da**.",
    "**Em cima da** table (on top of the table), **debaixo do** sofa (under the couch), **ao lado do** bank (next to the bank), **dentro da** bad (inside the bag), **em frente do** sofa (opposite the couch), **atrás da** carrier (behind the door).",
    "**Entre** goes without «de»: enter or bank to broom."
   ]
